 "_comment_ldmatrix_atom": [
  "make_copy_atom(warp.LdMatrix8x8x16bOp(transpose, num_matrices), dtype).",
  "Oracle: cutlass.cute -- the atom's thr_id, layout_src_tv and layout_dst_tv,",
  "each with size/cosize and its value at every point of the domain.",
  "Ported by tabs/make_copy_atom.js:mcaLdmatrixAtom, which re-expresses the",
  "instruction's fixed 16-bit geometry in the chosen element type. The cases",
  "cover the three structural branches of that arithmetic: element == the 16-bit",
  "transpose unit (half_t), element smaller than it (int8_t), and element larger",
  "than it (float/double), where the transposed thread mode drops below 32 lanes.",
  "num_matrices also drives the stride-0 broadcast mode -- x1 and x2 have one, x4",
  "does not -- so size > cosize on the src side is checked for free by `record`."
 ],
